================================================================================
Origin and lineage
================================================================================

MnM was forked from Paperclip (https://github.com/paperclipai/paperclip).
The two projects have since diverged substantially in vision, scope, and
architecture. Original portions of code derived from Paperclip retain their
upstream copyright; modifications and new code are copyright Alpha Luppi.

